    {
      "id": "update-reflection-capture-contents",
      "name": "UpdateReflectionCaptureContents",
      "category": "ReflectionCaptureComponent",
      "signature": "UpdateReflectionCaptureContents(World To Update, Capture Reason, Verify Only Capturing, Capturing For Mobile, Inside Tick)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "World To Update",
          "type": "UWorld*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Capture Reason",
          "type": "TCHAR*",
          "default": "nullptr"
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify Only Capturing",
          "type": "Bool",
          "default": "false"
        },
        {
          "name": "Capturing For Mobile",
          "type": "Bool",
          "default": "false"
        },
        {
          "name": "Inside Tick",
          "type": "Bool",
          "default": "false"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Generally called each tick to recapture any queued reflection captures.  In some cases, it's also called from Editor utility functions or commands.\nSet \"bInsideTick\" to true if called from inside a Tick function, indicating a render frame is already active, and the capture doesn't need to start one."
